<title>Central African Republic: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/car/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-car-2026-11-25T19:29:15.165Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:29:15 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;CAR forces have completed Rwanda special forces and basic special operations training and have neutralised 34 Boko Haram and ISWAP fighters in the Lake Chad area. The UN Security Council renewed the MINUSCA mandate to 2027, lowered the troop ceiling to 12,000 and ordered a gradual drawdown of peacekeepers. Saudi backing now funds a second year of a Sahel counter-terrorism programme centred on Chad while tensions rise between Chad and Niger and a prison break in Chad caused two inmate deaths and 30 escapes. Wagner’s gold interests continue to block peace efforts, and 246 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOSHpRU1pDcDlaZ2M0UnVJSE1HRjJCcmFxcGNZdWxOdk5TUG50R0ptYzdHVXdDZGVDZERicG9BV1pybjdZZURFS0lzSm15eTd4NWdXUjByQ3hhN184OG5JUXFwWHhpVWJlUlBQX0RyTm45RjRES0ZVNG9vVDdqbDZ6aWNFeUJ1NVNjTGo3ZVNZODAtV0Y0SVZVOEN1bmdtUGJkZmZtYTFxWTFjUV9GOENnZV93WXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Audacy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPempKY2E5OVlDQmRYTmlLQVRnQUtWUGVkWmMzNU5nenFMY1F4cHFOY3ZORUZySTJ6ckU3U0lwdXdzblZqaU43VVJCWUFaUmtjNUtCZE80dkdBSHkzQW5nalBuYUxpa0VzQVpwSWxRT3hzb09YZV9jQnhCLVg1RkJINTlLREY5N0FDY01SVXpRWGFMdGlL?oc=5&quot;&gt;Middle East Eye&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQLS1tWFJZaFNCcjMzb19QNnpuem5LVFZQM0RxVzJkZmdxdVZOa29HZFRZcFh2dXRFU0VSMFlWMk5zMEtzVG8zaG0yUDJWWkZERUdSRlRYR3k4Q0pBSThFMzh4MEEtNE5jNXRrMTc3dnpVNjlEOEFmY2F4b3lkSFlWczQwNl9hT01zc0Q0X3Qtb2JOeXRMNlpPaGtXUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Journal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxPbXBTWXAxSzhjTnV6Qy01TXZ3VlY4NmtTS0UtdWVHMVJUUjNEUEl6b1hKM2JiTEg3cjdlTVd1T3BjcDhaODc5YVFFblBOeW9mU3Vrb253UjlzQ09TR